'''100 Thieves''' is an [[:Category:United States|American]] organization formed by former [[OpTic Gaming]] ''Call of Duty'' player, co-owner and personality, Matthew "[[wikipedia:Nadeshot|Nadeshot]]" Haag and NBA team [[wikipedia:Cleveland Cavaliers|Cleveland Cavaliers]].

==Timeline==
