|content1= <!-- 2019 -->
* February 25th - '''100 Thieves''' enters ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[Gigz]]. <ref name="Gigz Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1100123311529316352|title=Introducing our very first Apex Legends player, @Gigz. |author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2019-02-25|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* February 26th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Teenage]]. <ref name="Teenage Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1100485711491301376|title=Introducing our newest Apex Legends player, @Teenage.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2019-02-26|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* February 27th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Lifted]]. <ref name="Lifted Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1100863138906365952|title=Welcome to 100 Thieves, @100T_Lifted!|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2019-02-27|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* April 8th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[JP2]]. <ref name="JP2 Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1115357604782325760|title=Welcome our newest Apex Legends player, @100T_JP2!|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2019-04-08|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 27th - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with [[Teenage]], [[Lifted]] and [[JP2]]. <ref name="Disband">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1166442214240788482|title=Today we part ways with our Apex Legends team.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2019-08-27|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content2= <!-- 2020 -->
* May 28th - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with [[Gigz]]. <ref name="Gigz Leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100ThievesLive/status/1266066749759225857|title=Today we part ways with @Gigz|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2020-05-28|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content3= <!-- 2021 -->
* September 12th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[NiceWigg]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="NiceWigg Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1437113827233988609|title=Welcome @NiceWigg to 100 Thieves!|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2021-09-12|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 8th - '''100 Thieves''' acquires the roster of [[Kungarna NA]]. [[Onmuu]], [[scuwry]] and [[Vein]] join. <ref name="KNG Join">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1446551013020749825|title=100 THIEVES IS BACK IN APEX LEGENDS|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2021-10-08|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content4= <!-- 2022 -->
* February 15th - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with [[Vein]]. <ref name="Vein Leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100T_Esports/status/1493722024774144000|title=Ahead of ALGS Split 2|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2022-02-15|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> 
* February 23rd - '''100 Thieves''' acquires [[Vaxlon]] from [[Renegades]]. <ref name="Vaxlon Joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Vaxlon/status/1496623229582065665|title=Joined @100Thieves|author=[[Vaxlon]]|date=2022-02-23|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 9th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[iiTzTimmy]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="iiTzTimmy joins">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/iiTzTimmy/status/1590434134916497410|title=Joined @100Thieves @Higround|author=[[iiTzTimmy]]|date=2022-11-09|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 14th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Sickks]] as ''Head Coach''. <ref name="Sickks joins">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100T_Esports/status/1603117622127632388|title=Introducing @SickksT9, the Head Coach for our Apex Legends roster.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2022-12-14|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content5= <!-- 2023 -->
* June 21st - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Bronzey]] as ''Community Manager''. <ref name="Bronzey joins">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Bronzey/status/1671662884231987200|title=I have relocated to LA and joined @100Thieves! |author='''Bronzey'''|date=2023-06-21|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 22nd - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with [[scuwry]], [[Onmuu]], [[Vaxlon]] and coach [[Sickks]]. <ref name="100T Y3 leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100T_Esports/status/1705265747029893478|title=Today we say farewell to triple MnK|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2023-09-22|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content6= <!-- 2024 -->
* November 11th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[The Dojo]]. [[Genburten]] and [[Dezignful]] join while [[iiTzTimmy]] moves over from his streaming position and [[Bronzey]] turning into the coach. <ref name="100T Y4 return">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/1856079667960369197|title=Apex Legends, we've returned. |author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2024-11-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content7= <!-- 2025 -->
* March 5th - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with [[iiTzTimmy]] and [[Dezignful]]. <ref name="iiTzTimmy leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100Thieves/status/1897346452579356761|title=Today we say goodbye to Timmy as both a 100 Thieves creator, and as an Apex player.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2025-03-05|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="Dezignful leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_Esports/status/1897361512962170961|title=It's been a ride. Thanks for everything, @Dezignfull 🖤|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2025-03-05|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* March 7th - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Verhulst]] and acquired [[Phony]] from [[Guild Esports]]. <ref name="100T 2025">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_Esports/status/1898071158911909919|title=No such thing as too many World Champions.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2025-03-07|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 22nd - [[Bronzey]] steps down from his coaching position, and transitions within 100 Thieves' apparel team. <ref name="Bronzey no coach">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/Bronzey/status/1970186482800574960|title=Decided to step down from the coach role to put more focus on the apparel side of @100Thieves. |author=[[Bronzey]]|date=2025-09-22|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 23rd - '''100 Thieves''' signs [[Balvarine]] as coach. <ref name="Balvarine joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_Esports/status/1970578987383685185|title=Please welcome @BalvarineFPS as the Head Coach of 100 Thieves Apex. |author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2025-09-23|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content8= <!--2026-->
* January 3rd - '''100 Thieves''' parts ways with streamer [[NiceWigg]]. <ref name="NiceWigg leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100Thieves/status/2007512343258022198|title=Today, after 4 incredible years, we say goodbye to @NiceWigg as a 100 Thieves creator.|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2026-01-03|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* January 5th - [[NiceWigg]] returns as a Co-Owner. <ref name="NiceWigg Owner">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100Thieves/status/2008291428204769288|title=Welcome, Co-Owner. @NiceWigg|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2026-01-05|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* January 7th - [[Crazy Thieves]] is formed as a collaboration between '''100 Thieves''' and [[Crazy Raccoon]]. [[Verhulst]], [[Phony]], [[Genburten]] and coach [[Balvarine]] leave to join the team. <ref name="CRT">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_Esports/status/2008690068513493239|title=Crazy Thieves have entered Sapporo |author=[[Crazy Thieves]]|date=2026-01-07|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
}}

