'''Alliance''' is a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization that was founded in April 2013 and is currently co-owned and ran by  Jonathan "[[dota2:Loda|Loda]]" Berg, Kelly Ong Xiao Wei and Henrik "[[dota2:AdmiralBulldog|AdmiralBulldog]]" Ahnberg.

Alliance was introduced as one of the partnered teams for the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2023-24|4th year of ALGS]]. <ref name="ALGS 2024 partner">[https://www.ea.com/games/apex-legends/compete/news/year4-partner-program YEAR 4: PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM]</ref>
