|content1= <!-- 2019 -->
* April 11th - '''Alliance''' enters ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[LAZXR]], [[Lowley]] and [[Vaifs]]. <ref name="New team">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/alliance-adds-apex-legends-division/|title=ALLIANCE WELCOME LEGENDS – LAZXR, VAIFS AND LOWLEY|author='''Alliance'''|date=2019-04-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 19th - [[LAZXR]] parts ways with '''Alliance'''. <ref name="lazxr leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/DWadenfors/status/1163496943273807872?s=19|title=Sadly I'm now a F/A and are looking for a team to represent in Apex Legends. @PlayApex @APEXPRODiscord  @ApexProEurope|author=[[LAZXR]]|date=2019-08-19|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content2= <!-- 2020 -->
* January 8th - '''Alliance''' announces that [[Lowley]] will be inactive for a medical break. <ref name="Lowley leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/theAllianceGG/status/1214933458847436800|title=Thank you @Lowley123 for being A part of our journey in Kings Canyon & World's Edge.|author='''Alliance'''|date=2020-01-08|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* January 15th - '''Alliance''' signs [[hakis]]. <ref name="hAKIS joins">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/welcome-hakis-to-alliance-apex/|title=WELCOME HAKIS TO ALLIANCE APEX|publisher='''Alliance'''|date=2020-01-15|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* April 20th - '''Alliance''' signs [[iPN]], replacing [[Lowley]]. <ref name="ipn joins">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/news/1018/alliance-re-signs-apex-legends-division|title=Alliance commits to Apex Legends by re-contracting our roster, along with a new player|publisher='''Alliance'''|date=2020-04-20|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content3= <!-- 2021 -->
* April 23rd - '''Alliance''' announces that they sign their ''Apex Legends'' roster for two more years. <ref name="2 more years">{{cite web |url=http://thealliance.gg/two-more-years-with-alliances-legends/|title=TWO MORE YEARS WITH ALLIANCE'S LEGENDS|publisher='''Alliance'''|date=2021-04-23|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 28th - '''Alliance''' benches [[iPN]]. <ref name="iPN benched">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Alliance_iPN/status/1431421167701794816|title=Been benched from Alliance|author=[[iPN]]|date=2021-08-28|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 31st - '''Alliance''' signs [[Yuki]]. <ref name="Yuki joins">{{cite web |url=https://thealliance.gg/welcomeyuki/|title=Been benched from Alliance|publisher='''Alliance'''|date=2021-08-28|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content4= <!-- 2022 -->
* March 3rd - '''Alliance''' parts ways with inactive [[iPN]]. <ref name="iPN leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/theAllianceGG/status/1499369793320849409|title=Today we mutually part ways with @Alliance_iPN as he is heading for new adventures!|author='''Alliance'''|date=2022-03-03}}</ref>
