'''Luminosity Gaming''' (Briefly also known as '''LG Chivas''' in Apex Legends) is a [[:Category:North America|North American]] esports organization that currently fields in ''[[counterstrike:Counter-Strike|Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'', ''[[wikipedia:Smite|Smite]]'', ''[[wikipedia:League of Legends|League of Legends]]'', ''[[hearthstone:Hearthstone|Hearthstone]]'', ''[[overwatch:Overwatch|Overwatch]]'', ''[[wikipedia:World of Warcraft|World of Warcraft]]'' and ''[[wikipedia:Call of Duty: Black Ops 3|Call of Duty: Black Ops 3]]''. On June 29th, '''Luminosity Gaming''' partnered with football club ''Club Deportivo Guadalajara'' and establishes '''LG Chivas''', the partnership seemingly ended with the release of the Mexican Apex Legends team.

Luminosity Gaming was introduced as one of the partnered teams for the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2023-24|4th year of ALGS]]. <ref name="ALGS 2024 partner">[https://www.ea.com/games/apex-legends/compete/news/year4-partner-program YEAR 4: PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM]</ref>

