* May 10th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' enters ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[chipzy]], [[Yogi]] and [[Sloth]]. <ref name="Form">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Luminosity/status/1126873364067422208|date=2019-05-10 |title=NEWS: Luminosity Gaming enters APEX LEGENDS!|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
