* September 13th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' signs [[Crank]] and [[JP2]], replacing [[Sloth]]. <ref name="Crank JP2 join">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Luminosity/status/1172466664014671873|date=2019-09-13|title=Live from Krakow, Poland, @JP2ll makes his returning debut |author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
