* July 29th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' sign [[Wrugb]] and [[Sanya]], replacing [[Exens]] and [[Esdesu]]. <ref name="wrugb sanya join">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Luminosity/status/1288232766673305600|date=2020-07-29|title=Join us in welcoming our 2020 APEX Competitive Team|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 27th - [[xaniya]] parts ways with '''Luminosity Gaming'''. <ref name="xaniya leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/xaniyaWasTaken/status/1321199563865231362|date=2020-10-27|title=I'm no longer a part of @Luminosity gaming anymore|author=[[xaniya]]|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> 
