* June 29th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' partners with football club ''Club Deportivo Guadalajara'' (Also known as '''Chivas''') and establishes '''LG Chivas'''. <ref name="LGCHIVAS">{{cite web|url=https://luminosity.gg/news/luminosity-gaming-and-club-deportivo-guadalajara-forge-strategic-esports-partnership-unveiling-lg-chivas|title=LUMINOSITY GAMING AND CLUB DEPORTIVO GUADALAJARA FORGE STRATEGIC ESPORTS PARTNERSHIP, UNVEILING 'LG CHIVAS'|publisher='''Luminosity Gaming'''|date=2023-06-29|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
