* May 31st - '''Luminosity Gaming''' signs [[Sikezz]]. <ref name="sikezz joins">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Luminosity/status/1796693417751163132|title=Time to make this official. Welcome, @sSikezz|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|date=2024-05-31|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 18th - Streamer [[ShivFPS]] parts ways with '''Luminosity Gaming'''. <ref name="ShivFPS leaves">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShivFPS/status/1869163373503627591|title=The end of an era.|author=[[ShivFPS]]|date=2024-12-18|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
|content7= <!-- 2025 -->
* February 13th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' parts ways with their roster. [[sweetdreams]], [[Fuhhnq]], [[Sikezz]], coach [[Android Dream]] and analyst [[Sven]] leave. <ref name="2025 end">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Luminosity/status/1890143488278425937|date=2025-02-13|title=We've had a fantastic year, and as of now, our team is officially unrestricted free agents. Wishing the team the best on their future endeavors.|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>  
* March 6th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' returns by signing the former [[Cloud9]] roster. [[Sauceror]], [[StayNaughty]], [[Shooby]] and coach [[Android Dream]] join. <ref name="2025 new">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Luminosity/status/1897799424715505772|date=2025-03-06|title=We're back in Apex and feeling on Cloud 9.|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>  
* May 7th - [[Sauceror]] parts ways with '''Luminosity Gaming'''. <ref name="Sauceror leaves">{{cite web |url=https://x.com/saucerorr/status/1920240534829908433|date=2025-05-07|title=LFT for PL|author=[[sauceror]]|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 25th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' signs [[oh Nocturnal]]. <ref name="Nocturnal joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/Luminosity/status/1926760195176145050|title=Let's welcome @oh_Nocturnal as he makes his LG Apex debut.|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''|date=2025-05-25|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 12th - [[oh Nocturnal]] leaves. <ref name="Nocturnal leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/oh_Nocturnal/status/1955364845194448949|title=Last second but LFT - only a week til roster lock!|author=[[oh Nocturnal]]|date=2025-08-12|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
