'''Sentinels''' is a [[:Category:North America|North American]] esports organization based in Los Angeles which fields teams in ''[[fortnite:Sentinels|Fortnite]]'', ''[[hearthstone:Sentinels|Hearthstone]]'', ''[[apexlegends:Sentinels|Apex Legends]]'', ''[[wildrift:Sentinels|Wild Rift]]'', ''[[halo:Sentinels|Halo]]'' and ''[[valorant:Sentinels|VALORANT]]''.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
