|content1= <!-- 2019 -->
* March 26th - '''Sentinels''' enters ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[Payne]], [[zombs]], and [[xretzi]]. <ref name="Form">{{cite web|url=https://www.sentinels.gg/news-content/sentinels-expand-into-apex-legends|title=PRESS RELEASE: SENTINELS EXPAND INTO APEX LEGENDS|author='''Sentinels'''|date=2019-03-26|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* June 20th - '''Sentinels''' signs [[senoxe]]. <ref name="senoxe joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.sentinels.gg/news-content/senoxe-joins-the-apex-legends-team|title=PRESS RELEASE: SENOXE JOINS THE APEX LEGENDS TEAM|author='''Sentinels'''|date=2019-06-20|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content2= <!-- 2020 -->
* March 31st - [[Payne]] parts ways with '''Sentinels'''. <ref name="Payne leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Payne/status/1245109913652772864|title=<3|author=[[Payne]]|date=2020-03-31|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* April 28th - [[zombs]] announces his retirement to move to ''[[valorant:Sentinels|VALORANT]]'' division. <ref name="zombs Valorant">{{cite web|url=https://www.sentinels.gg/news-content/sentinels-expand-into-valorant|title=SENTINELS EXPAND INTO VALORANT|author='''Sentinels'''|date=2020-04-28|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 29th - '''Sentinels''' signs [[peesh]] and [[crust]], as [[retzi]] steps down from the active roster. <ref name="Sentinels 2020">{{cite web|url=https://www.sentinels.gg/news-content/sentinels-sign-peesh-and-crust|title=SENTINELS SIGN PEESH AND CRUST|author='''Sentinels'''|date=2020-05-29|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 12th - [[peesh]] parts ways with '''Sentinels'''. <ref name="peesh leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/peesh/status/1304973789500002306|title=LFT for Series E and upcoming autumn circuit.|author=[[peesh]]|date=2020-09-12|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> 
* October 1st - [[retzi]] returns to the active roster. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Sentinels/status/1311742713495257091|title=The world's first Apex Predator returns.|author=[[retzi]]|date=2020-10-01|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content3= <!-- 2021 -->
* August 27th - [[retzi]] announces his retirement. <ref name="retzi retires">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1srq5b2|title=quitting apex // my future|author=[[retzi]]|date=2021-08-27|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> 
* October 20th - '''Sentinels''' signs [[Lou]]. <ref name="Lou joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/LouStreams/status/1450915533537284096|title=Thank @Sentinels for the opportunity.|author=[[Lou]]|date=2021-10-20|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

|content4= <!-- 2022 -->
