* November 11th - '''Sentinels''' signs [[aceu]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="aceu joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Sentinels/status/1591234710822215680|title=The human highlight reel is officially a Sentinel|author='''Sentinels'''|date=2022-11-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 15th - [[lou]] steps down from the active line-up. <ref name="lou offteam">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/senoxe/status/1592564672657788929|title=Moving forward, SEN is looking for a new third for all future tournaments & events.|author=[[senoxe]]|date=2022-11-15|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

