{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}<!-- 2019 -->
* March 6th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Rogue (Canadian player)|Rogue]], [[Flanker]], [[caliburn]], and [[Casper]]. <ref name="New Team">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2019/03/06/champion-squad-liquid-moves-to-apex-legends|title=Champion Squad: Liquid moves to Apex Legends |author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-03-06|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* April 25th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[geesh]]. <ref name="Geesh joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2019/04/25/oh-my-gosh-its-geesh|title=Oh My Gosh It's Geesh!|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-04-25|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* June 13th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[nasticle]]. <ref name="nasticle joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2019/06/13/welcome-nasticle-to-our-apex-legends-team|title=Welcome Nasticle to our Apex Legends Team|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-06-13|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 11th - [[nasticle]] and [[geesh]] part ways with '''Team Liquid'''. <ref name="nasticle leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/nasticle/status/1160651115454763013|title=Free Agent for future tournaments - DMs will be open|author=[[nasticle]]|date=2019-08-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="geesh leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/geesh/status/1160631530789560321|title=F/A for poland. My side of the story will come soon.|author=[[geesh]]|date=2019-08-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Mendokusaii]], replacing [[Rogue (Canadian player)|Rogue]]. <ref name="mendo joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1161368523089858561?s=20|title=Join us in welcoming @Mendo to Team Liquid!|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-08-13|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="rogue leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Liquid_Rogue/status/1161370585747865602?s=20|title=Free Agent for anything Apex Legends related!|author=[[Rogue (Canadian player)|Rogue]]|date=2019-08-13|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 11th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Kellar]] and [[Wonderfuls]]. <ref name="squad cali mendo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1171862431624290305|title="I'm joining the best org in esports alongside my best friends so it was a pretty easy choice for me."|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-09-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 22nd - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[oh Nocturnal]]. <ref name="noc joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2019/10/22/welcome-ohnocturnal-to-our-apex-legends-team|title=Welcome ohNocturnal To Our Apex Legends Team|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-10-22|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 16th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Mad_Ruski]] as ''Coach''. <ref name="ruski joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2019/11/16/welcome-mad_ruski-tls-new-apex-legends-coach|title=Welcome Mad_Ruski - TL's new Apex Legends coach|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2019-11-16|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}<!-- 2020 -->
* May 1st - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[hodsic]] as ''Coach''. <ref name="hodsic joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2020/05/01/galaxy-brain-coaching-welcome-hodsic|title=Galaxy Brain Coaching - Welcome Hodsic|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2020-05-01|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* June ??th - [[Wonderfuls]] and [[Kellar]] leave.
* October 28th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Albralelie]] as ''Stand-in''. <ref name="Alb joins">{{inside source|lp-author=Kanoodles|date=2021-10-28}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}<!-- 2021 -->
* June 11th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with [[Casper]], [[Kellar]] and [[Wonderfuls]]. <ref name="Casper leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1403404160771493892|title=Brenden @Liquid_Casper, you've got a heart of gold and the strength of steel. |author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2021-06-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* June 13th - [[Albralelie]] ''(Stand-in)'' parts ways with '''Team Liquid'''. <ref name="Alb leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TSM_Albralelie/status/1404272537769582594|title=Sorry for letting you guys|author=[[Albralelie]]|date=2021-06-13|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* July 7th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[FunFPS]] as ''Stand-in''. <ref name="Fun joins">{{inside source|lp-author=oh Nocturnal|date=2021-07-07}}</ref>
* July 15th - Streamer [[Mad_Ruski]] parts ways with '''Team Liquid'''. <ref name="Mad_Ruski leaves">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Mad_Ruski/status/1415357672958959625|title=Just applied!|author=[[Mad_Ruski]]|date=2021-07-15|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* July 14th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with [[Cali]]. <ref name="Cali leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1415340312621326336|title=From Call Of Duty to Apex Legends|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2021-07-14|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 16th - '''Team Liquid''' officially signs [[FunFPS]]. <ref name="fun joins official">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1449437387067740163|title=You see, @ApexLegends is not only about the highlights and dubs.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2021-10-16|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 2nd - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Acie]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="Acie joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1466467205910974464|title=Her love for the community and drive to inspire make @AcieTwitch|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2021-12-02|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|4}}<!-- 2022 -->
* March 3rd - '''Team Liquid''' acquires [[Gildersons]] from [[Pittsburgh Knights]]. [[Flanker]] steps down from the active roster. <ref name="Gildersons joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1499504899876429829|title=We've had one yes, but about a second Liquid Gild?|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2022-03-03|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 12th - [[Gildersons]] is acquired by [[NRG]]. <ref name="Gildersons leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Gildersons_/status/1558121391605649408|title=Joined @NRGgg.|author=[[Gildersons]]|date=2022-08-12|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 12th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Rogue (Canadian player)|Rogue]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="Rogue streamer">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1591536310535217157|title=Once again, he is home. |author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2022-11-12|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 15th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with the roster. [[oh Nocturnal]], [[FunFPS]], [[Flanker]] and coach [[hodsic]] leave. <ref name="Farewell algs">{{cite web|url=https://www.teamliquid.com/news/2022/12/15/farewell-algs|title=Farewell ALGS|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2022-12-15|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 23rd - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[TiffaJessi]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="TiffaJessi joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1606379201854312448|title=She’s fierce. She’s funny. She’s cracked.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2022-12-23|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|5}}<!-- 2023 -->
* January 11th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Ambush]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="ambush joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1613279603875008512|title=Our favorite Swedish Apex Queen is joining the Wave 🌊 Welcome @AmbushAB|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2023-01-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* December 2nd - Streamer [[TiffaJessi]] leaves. <ref name="TiffaJessi leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TiffaJessi/status/1730986669556498789|title=I have decided to part ways with Team Liquid. Very thankful for the time that I was on the org but it just wasn’t the right fit for me. |author=[[TiffaJessi]]|date=2023-12-02|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|6}}<!-- 2024 -->
* May 2nd - '''Team Liquid''' returns to ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[LEGACY (Mexican team)|LEGACY]]. [[YanYa]], [[Neazul]], [[Jaguares]] and coach [[Pistillo]] join. <ref name="TL MX">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid_ES/status/1786078197077139848|title=NUESTRO LEGADO EMPIEZA AHORA Team Liquid Alienware Apex Legends 👽|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2024-05-02|language={{Flag|esmx}} Spanish}}</ref>
* September 27th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with [[YanYa]] as he is acquired by [[Bleed Esports]]. <ref name="YanYa leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquid/status/1839711826373742980|title=Today, we part ways with @YanYaMx.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2024-09-27|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="YanYa joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ggBleed/status/1839714588972982605|title=We’re thrilled to announce the addition of @YanYaMx to our Apex Legends roster!|author=[[Bleed Esports]]|date=2024-09-27|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''Team Liquid''' acquires [[Kurev]] from [[E-Xolos LAZER]]. <ref name="Kurev joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1840089092333162586|title=Welcome @Kurevvv to Team Liquid Alienware👽|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2024-09-28|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 2nd - '''Team Liquid''' acquires [[Stressado]] as coach from [[E-Xolos LAZER]]. [[Pistillo]] turns into a manager. <ref name="Stressado joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1841601432555786454|title=Coach @1Stressado joins Team Liquid Alienware👽|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2024-10-02|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|7}}<!-- 2025 -->
* May 11th - [[Kurev]] leaves the starting roster. <ref name="Kurev lft">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/Kurevvv/status/1921674455488586063|title=LFT, extensive knowledge of every role but would prefer IGLing.|author=[[Kurev]]|date=2025-05-11|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 13th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[YanYa]]. <ref name="YanYa joins 2">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1922718362280370219|title=Votes are in.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2025-05-13|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 21st - [[Kurev]] is acquired by [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]. <ref name="9L NIP">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/NIP/status/1925220246220156930|title=You'll be Raven about our new Apex Legends Roster!|author=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]|date=2025-05-21|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* September 18th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with coach [[Stressado]]. [[Pistillo]] returns to his role as a coach. <ref name="Stressado leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1968778090424742272|title=We’re parting ways with our Apex Legends coach, @1Stressado.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2025-09-18|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref><ref name="Pistillo coach">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1968781817550352418|title=Co-Coach & Manager @PistilloMx will be returning to the roster full time as Head Coach.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2025-09-18|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* October 17th - '''Team Liquid''' puts [[Neazul]], [[Jaguares]] and [[YanYa]] on inactive as restricted free agents. <ref name="TL MX Benched">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid/status/1979291516335001993|title=As of today, @yanyamx, @jaguaresapex, and @neazulyuuji have been given the opportunity to explore their options as restricted free agents.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2025-10-17|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 5th - '''Team Liquid''' signs the roster of [[ZZ (American team)|ZZ]]. [[Zer0]], [[Sikezz]], [[Fuhhnq]] and coach [[tiltedwinnie]] join. <ref name="TL ZZ">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid_APEX/status/1986126498575614272|title=You thought we were leaving? Sikezz! There’s Zer0 chance this won’t be Fuhhnq. |author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2025-11-05|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* November 30th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with inactive players [[Neazul]], [[Jaguares]] and [[YanYa]]. <ref name="TL MX leave">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/YanyaMx/status/1995233105062306015|title=Today we officially become free agents, parting ways with @TeamLiquid.|author=[[YanYa]]|date=2025-11-30|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|8}}<!-- 2026 -->
* February 18th - '''Team Liquid''' puts [[Fuhhnq]] and coach [[tiltedwinnie]] on inactive as restricted free agents. <ref name="Fuhhnq winnie inactive">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid_APEX/status/2024278504737812829|title=Today, @fuhhnq and @tiltedwinnie have been granted permission to explore their options as restricted free agents.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2026-02-18|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* February 19th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Panic (American player)|Panic]]. <ref name="Panic joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid_APEX/status/2024544897412583745|title=We know yesterday's announcement may have come as a surprise but there is no need to Panic, this guy's got us covered.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2026-02-19|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* March 25th - '''Team Liquid''' signs [[Kapreme]] as a coach. <ref name="Kapreme joins">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquid_APEX/status/2036606142336672052|title=No Kap, we've got some big APEX news! There's a preem addition to the lineup we're proud to announce.|author='''Team Liquid'''|date=2026-03-25|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* April 16th - '''Team Liquid''' parts ways with [[Fuhhnq]]. <ref name="Fuhhnq leaves">{{inside source|lp-author=Kanoodles|date=2026-04-16}}</ref>
* April 21st - Inactive coach [[tiltedwinnie]] is acquired by [[ROC Esports]]. <ref name="winnie leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/esports_ROC/status/2046640762826211676|title=Built on what we had 💜|author=[[ROC Esports]]|date=2026-04-21|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
