'''VK Gaming''' ('''威卡电竞''') is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] esports organization based in Chengdu, Sichuan, and is owned by [https://verykuai.com/ VeryKuai]. The organization also owns [[VeryAPEX Community]] which hold many Chinese or APAC South events. Since '''VK Gaming''' was founded based on the ex-[[MDY]] players, they often use the abbreviation '''VKMDY''' in the games as well.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4
}}
{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}
* February 19th - VeryKuai formally establish '''VK Gaming''' and sign the roster of [[MDY]], which has been already sponsored by VeryKuai for months. [[Kasssa]] and [[AZu]] join. And '''VK Gaming''' also sign former MDY player [[YouL1ng]], and [[Golden Sage]] streamer [[Jiepai]] as coach. <ref name="form">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1T54y1A7af<!-- This video isn't official announcement, it just collects the VOD clips for MDY players saying they go to VK Gaming office in Chengdu.-->|title=幽灵赶赴线下MDY会师成都|date=2023-02-19|author=奥莉安娜的微笑|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* March 19th - '''VK Gaming''' are caught that violating ALGS rules (coach was talking while ALGS was in progress), and get a penalty which nullifies all points of the first 2 ALGS game days. <ref name="Violate">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/774702531495329813|title=我违反了比赛规则 违背公平竞技原则 我愿接受一切处罚 辜负了大伙的期望 |date=2023-03-19|author=[[AZu]]|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* April 9th - [[AZu]] and [[Jiepai]] leave. <ref name="AZu leaves">{{cite web|url=https://yuba.douyu.com/p/418154551681037417|title=明天开始，收拾东西回家|date=2023-04-09|author=[[AZu]]|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* April 14th - '''VK Gaming''' is banned by ALGS for 6 months. <ref name="ALGS ban">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/im_b_rad_ttv/status/1646692424683749377|title=EA/Respawn handing them what is said to be a 6 month BAN!|date=2023-04-14|author=[[im_b_rad]]|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 22nd - [[XiaoKai]] joins. <ref name="XiaoKai joins">{{inside source|source=kassssa|date=2023-05-22}}</ref>
* September 18th - [[YouL1ng]] turns into substitute. <ref name="YouL1ng turns into substitute">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/842394162487623721|title=休息一阵 |date=2023-09-18|author=[[YouL1ng]]|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* September 22nd - [[KenTunG]] joins. <ref name="KenTunG joins">{{cite web|title=董哥现在就是MDY的人了是吗？是的|url=https://imgur.com/zjHrq96|author=[[KenTunG]]|date=2023-09-22|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* October 22nd - The ban from April 14th has expired. '''VK Gaming''' is able to compete in ALGS from now on. The invitation from ALGS League Operations to play in [https://liquipedia.net/apexlegends/Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2024/Split_1/Pro_League/APAC_South ALGS 2024 S1 Pro] ensured the end of the suspension.
* November 2nd - [[YouL1ng]] leaves. <ref name="YouL1ng_leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/859256474414612504|title=11月开始持续复活|date=2023-11-02|author=[[YouL1ng]]|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}
* January 6th - [[951]] returns from his retirement. <ref name="951 joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kg4y1D77F<!-- This video says 951 won't sign any formal contracts, but he would play Apex Legends with his long-time teammate Kasssa again(not sure whether he would play competitive Apex at the moment)-->|title=欢迎回来，青野。欢迎回归，VKG_Aono！|date=2024-01-06|author=[[VeryAPEX]]|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* January 31st - [[KenTunG]] leaves. <ref name="KenTunG leaves">{{cite web|url=https://battlefy.com/apex-legends-global-series-year-4/pro-league/transactions|title=KenTunG was removed from VK GAMING |date=2024-01-06|author=[[Battlefy]]|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* May 16th - [[XiaoKai]] turns into inactive. <ref name="XiaoKai inactive">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jx4y1W7b5|title=卡莎挽留小凯未果，小凯自愿离开vkg|author=[[kassssa]]|date=2024-05-16|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* May 19th - [[QQ]] joins. <ref name="QQ joins">{{cite web|title=现在已经有找到合适的队伍了|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ym421T7vm|author=[[QQ]]|date=2024-05-15|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* May 24th - [[Raizy]] joins as Coach. <ref name="Raizy joins">{{cite web|title=Raizy was added to VK GAMING|url=https://battlefy.com/apex-legends-global-series-year-4/pro-league/transactions|author=Battlefy|date=2024-05-15|language={{Flag|us}} English}}</ref>
* August 29th - [[XiaoKai]] serves as a coach. <ref name="XiaoKai coach">{{Inside source|lp-author=Flagchess}}</ref>
* September 2nd - [[951]] retires again. <ref name="951 retires">{{cite web|title=我的apex生涯对我而言已经圆满结束|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/972352240454991876|author=[[951]]|date=2024-09-02|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* September 5th - [[Raizy]] and [[XiaoKai]] leave. <ref name="Raizy and XiaoKai leave">{{cite web|title=Raizy & XiaoKai was removed from VK GAMING|url=https://battlefy.com/apex-legends-global-series-year-4/pro-league/transactions|publisher=Battlefy|date=2024-09-05|language={{Flag|us}} English}}</ref>
* September 25th - [[LqDuD]] joins. <ref name="Ld joins">{{cite web|title=LqDuD was added to VK GAMING|url=https://battlefy.com/apex-legends-global-series-year-4/pro-league/transactions|author=Battlefy|date=2024-09-25|language={{Flag|us}} English}}</ref>
* September 27th - [[YouL1ng]] joins as substitute. <ref name="YouL1ng joins">{{cite web|title=YouL1ng was added to VK GAMING|url=https://battlefy.com/apex-legends-global-series-year-4/pro-league/transactions|author=Battlefy|date=2024-09-27|language={{Flag|us}} English}}</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}
* February 2nd - [[Vita]] serves as a coach. <ref name="Vita joins">{{Inside source|lp-author=Kanoodles|source=Cav|date=2025-02-02}}</ref>
* August 5th - [[YouL1ng]] leaves to join [[MDY Black]]. <ref name="YouL1ng leaves">{{cite web|url=https://algs.ea.com/en/transactions|title=YouL1ngTxT (player) was removed from VK GAMING|publisher=ALGS|date=2025-08-05|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* August 8th - [[QQ]] turns into inactive. <ref name="QQ inactive1">{{cite web|title=还打比赛吗？皮蛋：不是不想打是有事处理，先挂替补吧。|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SRtyzhE6g|author=三明治的西红柿片|date=2025-08-08|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref><ref name="QQ inactive2">{{cite web|title=别在揣测我的事是啥事了，处理完会说的，该播还是播别再臆想了好吗，我把事情说出来不是让你们拿去臆想揣测的，只是通知你们一声|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1098676441357221893|author=[[QQ]]|date=2025-08-08|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''VK Gaming''' announces player recruitment. <ref>{{cite web|title=VKGaming战队再招募一名选手加入，一起征战2025ALGS常规赛第二赛段|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1100269569307574281|author='''VK Gaming'''|date=2025-08-13|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''VK Gaming''' signs [[BJJS_012]]. <ref name="BJJS_012 joins">{{cite web|title=【VKGaming电子竞技俱乐部人员变动公告】欢迎8000小时手柄高手@蛋蛋鼠的BJ 正式加入VKGaming！|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1101965724875751424|author='''VK Gaming'''|date=2025-08-13|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* November 28th - [[QQ]] returns to the active roster. <ref name="QQ return">{{cite web|title=VK Gaming2025冬日派对燃冬启幕！热血集结，嗨翻寒冬|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1138304116024410132?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0|author='''VK Gaming'''|date=2025-11-28|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|4}}
* May 12th - [[BJJS_012]] moves to an inactive position. <ref name="BJJS_012 inactive">{{Cite web|url=https://algs.ea.com/en/transactions|title=BJJS012 (player) was removed from VK GAMING|date=2026-05-12|publisher=ALGS|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''VK Gaming''' parts ways with [[QQ]] and [[LqDuD]] retires. <ref name="QQ leaves">{{Cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1223799704952766466|title=聚散终有时，征途仍继续。VKG-QQ 断开连接|date=2026-07-11|author='''VK Gaming'''|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref><ref name="LqDuD retires">{{Cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1223525346752593929|title=祝cnapex所有人武运昌隆 lqdud先歇了 加油大家加油|author=[[LqDuD]]|date=2026-07-11|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>
* August 2nd -  '''VK Gaming''' signs [[Noname]] and acquires [[JR]] from [[Weibo Gaming]]. <ref name="JR Noname join">{{Cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p5396DExN/|title=Welcome！JonnyR & N0NAME|date=2026-08-02|author='''VK Gaming'''|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese}}</ref>

