'''ZETA DIVISION''' is a [[:Category:Japan|Japanese]] esports organization, it was formerly named '''JUPITER'''.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2020
|name2=2021
|name3=2022
|name4=2023
|name5=2025
|name6=2026
|This=6
|content1=
* January 23rd - '''JUPITER''' announce its two ''Apex Legends'' teams. [[JIGEN]], [[Mate]] and [[YUKIO]] join '''JUPITER VEGA'''. <ref name="Team Formed">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2020/01/23/1507|title=APEX LEGENDS – Ak1to,ShelterA,SYACHI,JIGEN,Mate,YUKIO加入|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-01-23|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* January 31st - '''JUPITER''' sign [[dexyuku]] as ''Coach''. <ref name="dexyuku joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/JUPITER_GG/status/1223168796656979969|title=Apex Legends - コーチとしてdexyukuが加入|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-01-31|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* April 3rd - '''JUPITER''' sign [[t23tatsu]]. <ref name="t23tatsu joins">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2020/04/03/1707|title=Apex Legends – 「Apex Legends Global Series」Online Tournaments #3に出場|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-04-03|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* May 18th - [[dexyuku]] parts ways with '''JUPITER''' as his contract expires. <ref name="dexyuku leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/JUPITER_GG/status/1262215604527751168|title=APEX LEGENDS - dexyukuコーチの契約満了に伴う退団をご報告いたします。|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-05-18|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* June 8th - '''JUPITER''' part ways with [[YUKIO]]. <ref name="yukio leaves">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2020/06/08/2099|title=Apex Legends部門 YUKIO 退団|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-06-08|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* June 9th - '''JUPITER''' sign [[SudetakiN]]. <ref name="SudetakiN joins">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2020/06/09/2111|title=Apex Legends部門 – SudetakiN 加入|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-06-09|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* September 10th - '''JUPITER''' part ways with [[Mate]]. <ref name="Mate leaves">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2020/09/10/2353|title=Apex Legends – Mate 退団|publisher=[[JUPITER]]|date=2020-09-10|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref> 
|content2=
* April 23rd - [[SudetakiN]] announces his retirement and turns into ''Streamer''. <ref name="SudetakiN leaves">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2021/04/23/3195|title=Apex Legends – すでたき ストリーマー転向|author='''JUPITER'''|date=2021-04-23|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}
</ref> 
* April 27th - '''JUPITER''' sign [[sigluss]] as ''Coach'' and ''Analyst''. <ref name="sigluss joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/JUP_Esports/status/1386988409298690051|title=コーチ兼アナリストとしてsigluss( @sigluss )が新たに加入しました|author='''JUPITER'''|date=2021-04-27|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}
</ref> 
* June 16th - '''JUPITER''' part ways with [[sigluss]]. <ref name="sigluss leaves">{{cite web|url=https://jupitergaming.jp/news/2021/06/16/3343|title=ApexLegends – LiNlN1N, sigluss 退団|author='''JUPITER'''|date=2021-06-16|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* July 8th - '''JUPITER''' rebrand to '''ZETA DIVISION''' and sign [[StylishNoob]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="zeta">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/zetadivision/status/1413075863516553217|title=New look, New faces, Same vision.|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|date=2021-07-08|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* August 28th - '''ZETA DIVISION''' disband their ''Apex Legends'' division as [[JIGEN]] and [[t23tatsu]] are transferred to [[V3 VEGA]]. <ref name="JIGEN leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/zetadivision/status/1431532155457310720|title=ApexLegends部門 @JIGEN_GG と @t23tatsu が @V3EsportsJP へ移籍することをご報告いたします。|date=2021-08-28|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* August 31st - '''ZETA DIVISION''' re-enter ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[Fire Beavers]]. [[9impulse]], [[taskmast33r]] and [[Sunset]] join. <ref name="ZETA signs FB">{{cite web|url=https://zetadivision.com/news/2021/08/31/5973|title=Apex Legends – 9impulse, Sunset, taskmast33r 加入のお知らせ / 9impulse, Sunset and taskmast33r have joined|date=2021-08-31|publisher='''ZETA DIVISION'''|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* September 23rd - '''ZETA DIVISION''' sign [[k4sen]] as ''Streamer''. <ref name="k4sen joins">{{cite web|url=https://zetadivision.com/news/2021/09/23/6359|title=CREATOR – k4sen 加入のお知らせ|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|date=2021-09-23|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
|content3=
* April 30th - [[obo]] parts ways with '''ZETA DIVISION''' as his contract expires. <ref name="obo leaves">{{cite web|url=https://zetadivision.com/news/2022/04/30/9379|title=CREATOR部門 – おぼ 退団のお知らせ|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|date=2022-04-30|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* July 15th - The roster part ways with '''ZETA DIVISION''' as their contract expire. [[9impulse]], [[taskmast33r]] and [[Sunset]] leave. <ref name="ZETA disbands">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/zetadivision/status/1547823286859763712|title=この度、9impulse, Sunset, taskmast33rが契約満了に伴い退団、並びに同部門が解散す運びとなりました。|date=2022-07-15|publisher='''ZETA DIVISION'''|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
|content4=
* December 1st - Streamer [[Sudetaki]] is transferred to [[Reignite]]. <ref name="Sudetaki loan">{{Cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ReigniteJP/status/1730482441717186932|title=【Apex Legends部門編成】|author=[[Reignite]]|date=2023-12-01|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
|content5=
* February 20th - [[SudetakiN]] returns from [[REIGNITE]] to '''ZETA DIVISION''' as Streamer. <ref name="SudetakiN returns">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/zetadivision/status/1892408842224603428|title=この度、『Apex Legends Global Series Year4』が終了し、移籍期間が満了となったため、REIGNITEからすでたきが移籍加入する運びとなりました。|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|date=2025-02-20|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
* December 31st - [[StylishNoob]] leaves.<ref name="StylishNoob leaves">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zetadivision/status/2002302957233271133|title=THANK YOU FOR EVERYTHING|author='''ZETA DIVISION'''|language={{flag|jp}} Japanese|date=2025-12-20}}</ref>
|content6=
* February 25th - '''ZETA DIVISION''' returns to ''Apex Legends'' by signing [[YukaF]], [[ImMikeyyyz]], [[satuki]], coach [[Shuhei Yamato]] and analyst [[takuron]]. <ref name="ZETA 2026">{{Cite web|url=https://zetadivision.com/news/2026/02/25/41662|title=APEX LEGENDS部門再発足、及びメンバー加入のお知らせ|publisher='''ZETA DIVISION'''|date=2026-02-25|language={{Flag|jp}} Japanese}}</ref>
}}

